     1,
     "<span style=\"border-collapse:separate;color:rgb(255,255,255);font-family:&#39;Lucida Console&#39;;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:17px;text-align:-webkit-left;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:pre-wrap;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(0,34,64)\"><pre style=\"font-family:&#39;Lucida Console&#39;;font-size:11pt!important;outline-style:none;outline-width:initial;outline-color:initial;border-top-style:none;border-right-style:none;border-bottom-style:none;border-left-style:none;border-width:initial;border-color:initial;white-space:pre-wrap!important;margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:1.2\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,157,0);white-space:pre\">Good day All,<br><br>The following code throws an error when using panel.margin.<br>It works fine otherwise.<br><br>I was just trying to get more white space between facets.<br><br>Any hint on what I am doing wrong appreciated,<br><br>Thanks, JL<br><br>&gt; </span><span style=\"color:rgb(255,157,0)\">indivplot &lt;- function (x){\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(255,157,0);white-space:pre\">+ </span><span style=\"color:rgb(255,157,0)\">  p &lt;-   ggplot(subset(zm, subj == x ), aes(daycycle, value))\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(255,157,0);white-space:pre\">+ </span><span style=\"color:rgb(255,157,0)\">  </span><span style=\"color:rgb(255,157,0)\">p +  geom_point(aes(x=daycycle,y=value, colour = ovul), size= 3) + \r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(255,157,0);white-space:pre\">+ </span><span style=\"color:rgb(255,157,0)\">    facet_grid(variable~., scales=&quot;free_y&quot;) +\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(255,157,0);white-space:pre\">+ </span><span style=\"color:rgb(255,157,0)\">    scale_x_continuous(breaks = seq(3, 40, 5),limits=c(3, 40) ) +\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(255,157,0);white-space:pre\">+ </span><span style=\"color:rgb(255,157,0)\">    labs(title= paste(&quot;Subject&quot;, as.character(x),  sep=&quot;:&quot;)) +\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(255,157,0);white-space:pre\">+ </span><span style=\"color:rgb(255,157,0)\">    theme(plot.title = element_text(colour = &quot;blue&quot;), <span style=\"color:rgb(0,255,0)\">panel.margin = unit(2, &quot;lines&quot;)</span>,\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(255,157,0);white-space:pre\">+ </span><span style=\"color:rgb(255,157,0)\">          strip.text = element_text(colour = &quot;blue&quot;, size = 14,\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(255,157,0);white-space:pre\">+ </span><span style=\"color:rgb(255,157,0)\">                         face = &quot;bold.italic&quot;,  hjust = 0.5, vjust = 0.5))\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(255,157,0);white-space:pre\">+ </span><span style=\"color:rgb(255,157,0)\">     \r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(255,157,0);white-space:pre\">+ </span><span style=\"color:rgb(255,157,0)\">  ggsave(file=paste(&quot;subject&quot;, as.character(x),&quot;pdf&quot;, sep=&quot;.&quot;))        \r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(255,157,0);white-space:pre\">+ </span><span style=\"color:rgb(255,157,0)\">}\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(255,157,0);white-space:pre\">&gt; </span><span style=\"color:rgb(255,157,0)\">z &lt;- w[!<a href=\"http://is.na\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://is.na&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792374112110000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1Yg5MtaBJUq6H1YoKVecRg\">is.na</a>(w$site),]\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(255,157,0);white-space:pre\">&gt; </span><span style=\"color:rgb(255,157,0)\">zm &lt;- melt(z, id.vars= c(&quot;subj&quot;, &quot;site&quot;, &quot;daycycle&quot;, &quot;ovul&quot; ),\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(255,157,0);white-space:pre\">+ </span><span style=\"color:rgb(255,157,0)\">           measure.vars = c(&quot;folsiz&quot;, &quot;estro&quot;, &quot;progest&quot;, &quot;hooghra&quot;))\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(255,157,0);white-space:pre\">&gt; </span><span style=\"color:rgb(255,157,0)\">allsubj &lt;- as.list(unique(w$subj))\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(255,157,0);white-space:pre\">&gt; </span><span style=\"color:rgb(255,157,0)\">lapply(allsubj,indivplot)\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(255,98,140)\">Erreur dans theme(plot.title = element_text(colour = &quot;blue&quot;), panel.margin = unit(0,  : \r\n  impossible de trouver la fonction &quot;unit&quot;</span></pre></span>"
